# no_keymap and size 0, which used to panic inside the backend. draw must
# stay up and keep typing. Snapshots only: an older sway may not send
# no_keymap at all, and the case passes either way.
key t
click 200 200
text before
end-keyboard
text after
end-keyboard
text again
